            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.13.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 13:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ iki gisagara kizombera izina ry’umunezero, kimbere n’ishimwe n’icubahiro imbere y’amahanga yose yo mw isi, abazokwumva ivyiza vyose nabakoreye; bazotinya bahinde agashitsi kubg’ ivyiza vyose n’ amahoro yose ndahahaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni ko mvuze, jewe Uhoraho, nt’ Aha hantu aho muririra, ngo Harakomvomvowe, ata muntu agisigayeho cank’ igitungwa, ngo No mu bisagara vy’i Buyuda n’ uko, no mu miharuro y’i Yerusalemu, ngo Hasigaye ar’ imisaka, ata n’umuntu ata n’ūkihaba ata n’igitungwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
