              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aha hantu nyene hazosubira kwumvikana ijwi ry’umunezero n’iryo guhimbarwa, n’ijwi ry’umukwe n’iry’ umugeni, n’ijwi ry’abavuga, bati Ni mushime Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, kuk’ Uhoraho ari mwiza, kukw imbabazi ziwe zamaho ibihe bidashira; n’iry’ abazanye ibimazi vy’ishimwe mu ngoro yanje Uhoraho. Kuko nzotuma iki gihugu kiva mu kinyago, kikamera nk’ ubga mbere, ni jewe Uhoraho mbivuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
