          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uku ni ko mvuze, jewe Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, nt’ Aha hantu hakomvomvowe ata muntu agisigayeho cank’ igitungwa, no mu bisagara vyaho vyose ar’ uko, hazosubira kuboneka amarāro y’abungere bavyagiza imikuku yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
