              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’abaherezi b’Abalewi n’uko, ntibazokwigera babura uwo kuzokwama ahagarara imbere yanje ngw atange ibimazi avyose, ngo yose n’ibishikanywe, no kwama akerera ibimazi.",
          "type": "text",
